          "schema:name": "gypsy_moth_defoliation_time_seriesThe file \"gypsy_moth_defoliation.csv\" contains area defoliated (in units of square kilometers) by the gypsy moth from 1975 to 2014 in 64 x 64 km grid cells spanning the area\r\nconsidered \"generally infested\" by the gypsy moth (i.e., where gypsy moth populations were established) as of 1975. Defoliated area is based on aerial surveys.gypsy_moth_defoliation.csv",
